  "description": "Watch now | A discussion on the INSANE fundamentals of NVDA and market rundown",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only episode🔒 </strong></em>stock market update. Today we talk about which sectors are moving, tech, and why that is a good thing for the overall broader market for another leg up. The VIX appears to be conducting a re-test, with no major spikes, something we spoke about on Monday’s update. Additionally, with Nvidia, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVDA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> reaching a ludicrous market cap of $5 trillion dollars, we talk about whether it is time to short or not. Lastly, I discussed a few position updates for my holdings.</p><p>We have several new faces. All of the IMPORTANT links, are typically at the bottom of my posts, including here. <em><strong>You are always welcome to ping me in the main chat </strong></em>with any questions, <em><strong>during market hours</strong></em>. And the <strong>StockTok summary page</strong> lists my postions and all of the pre-screened stocks that meet are stringent requirements for investing in. There are both short term, and long term screeners to meet your personal preferences. Please note the “Short” screener is still under development, and has not had adequate public testing time…though you are welcome to check that out. </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p>Quick updates on positions below (and in video): 👇</p>",
